TC_LoginValidation_01

Title - Login validation - with valid username and password

preconditions -
user in login page
browser launched

1. open browser
2. Navigate to URL - "https://www.saucedemo.com/"
3. enter valid username - standard_user

4. Enter Valid password - secret_sauce
5. click on Login button
6. close browser

Expected Outcome -
User should be logged in
User should be landed in product pages - validate with page title - 'Products'

